Read-only copy of a nightly's system Flatpak installation (x86_64, Nov 2026):
/var/lib/flatpak/repo/config, repo/luma.trustedkeys.gpg, and the deploy and
metadata files of all 23 of Luma's own applications on that image. The luma remote comes from
/usr/share/flatpak/remotes.d/luma.flatpakrepo (configure-system.sh), the same
file as data/luma.flatpakrepo.
